{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2022-12-14 16:16:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL ANNOUNCES COURT APPROVAL OF NARCO TRUST BUYOUT AND PLANNED ACQUISITION OF HARBISONWALKER BY PLATINUM EQUITY', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) HAS ANNOUNCED COURT APPROVAL OF ITS BUYOUT AGREEMENT WITH THE NORTH AMERICAN REFRACTORIES ASBESTOS PERSONAL INJURY SETTLEMENT TRUST (THE "TRUST"), WHICH PROVIDES FOR THE ELIMINATION OF HONEYWELL\'S FUNDING OBLIGATIONS TO THE TRUST.'}